{
    "title": "Solitaire - Fishland",
    "description": "Solitaire - Fishland: the go-to Solitaire game for Solitaire card game fans, an all-new free game! \r\nTry challenging and fun Solitaire gameplay as you decorate aquariums to create cozy homes for lovely talking fishes!\r\nHey, your finned friends are waiting for you, so dive in now and enjoy this amazing underwater adventure! Feed them, play with them, and take care of them!\r\n\r\n============== Features ==============\r\n\u2660 Unique gameplay: play classic solitaire gameplay to design and decorate aquariums, take care of your fishes, and play with them!\r\n\u2660 Thousands of different challenges to keep you entertained! \r\n\u2660 Explore an exciting aquatic world, meet 3D talking fishes, and discover their personalities!\r\n\u2660 Enjoy amazing aquarium graphics!\r\n\u2660 No Wi-Fi or internet connection required, enjoy this game at anywhere and anytime!\r\n\r\nYour fishes are waiting for you, so come along and join in Solitaire - Fishland today.",
